  P("From American odds, a favorite's implied probability = |odds| ÷ (|odds| + 100), and an underdog's = 100 ÷ (odds + 100). Our " + '<a href="/implied_probability_calculator.html">Implied Probability Calculator</a>' + " handles all formats automatically."),
